aarch64 build of lsfg-vk v2.0.0 (upstream https://git.lsfg-vk.dev/lsfg-vk.git,
commit 2333707 "meta: Update version to v2.0.0"), unmodified, built with gcc 13:
  cmake -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
        -DLSFGVK_BUILD_UI=OFF -DLSFGVK_BUILD_CLI=ON
  ninja -C build
sha256 9e9b52dae38750852cddce97c1bc3e5ababa928ace44c52bbfa41a694c9b41d6

decky-lsfg-vk 0.14+ installs lsfg-vk 2.0 with x86 layers only. This layer sits
next to them under its own name (VK_LAYER_LSFGVK_frame_generation_arm64) so the
arm64 Vulkan loader uses it for ARM64 games; x86 games under FEX keep using the
plugin's x86 layer. Profiles still come from the plugin (matched by SteamAppId).

Licence: lsfg-vk 2.0 is CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 (by PancakeTAS, https://lsfg-vk.dev),
see /usr/share/licenses/lsfg-vk/LICENSE.txt. This is an unmodified build; the
licence allows compiling for other platforms ("technical modifications", 2(a)(4))
and free, non-commercial redistribution. Do not ship patched builds of 2.0.
